<div class="modal fade invoice-send-modal" id="invoiceSendModal" tabindex="-1" aria-labelledby="invoiceSendTitle" aria-describedby="invoiceSendDescription" aria-hidden="true">
  <div class="modal-dialog modal-dialog-centered"><div class="modal-content">
    <div class="modal-header">
      <div><span class="invoice-send-icon"><i class="bi bi-send" aria-hidden="true"></i></span><p class="invoice-send-eyebrow">FACTURATION · ENVOI PAR E-MAIL</p><h2 class="modal-title fs-4" id="invoiceSendTitle">Votre facture, prête à partir</h2></div>
      <button type="button" class="btn-close btn-close-white" data-bs-dismiss="modal" aria-label="Fermer"></button>
    </div>
    <div class="modal-body">
      <p id="invoiceSendDescription" class="text-muted">Vérifiez le destinataire avant de confirmer l’envoi.</p>
      <div class="invoice-send-summary"><span class="text-muted small">Facture</span><strong data-send-number></strong><hr><span class="text-muted small">Adresse de destination</span><strong data-send-recipient></strong></div>
      <a class="invoice-send-preview" data-send-preview target="_blank" rel="noopener"><i class="bi bi-file-earmark-pdf" aria-hidden="true"></i> Consulter le PDF avant l’envoi <i class="bi bi-box-arrow-up-right ms-auto" aria-hidden="true"></i></a>
      <p class="small text-muted mb-0 mt-3"><i class="bi bi-paperclip" aria-hidden="true"></i> La facture PDF sera jointe au message.</p>
      <div class="alert alert-warning mt-3 mb-0" data-send-error hidden role="alert">Aucune adresse e-mail n’est renseignée. Complétez la fiche du destinataire avant l’envoi.</div>
      <p class="visually-hidden" data-send-status role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
    </div>
    <div class="modal-footer"><button type="button" class="btn btn-outline-secondary" data-bs-dismiss="modal">Annuler</button><button type="button" class="btn invoice-send-confirm" data-send-confirm><i class="bi bi-send me-2" aria-hidden="true"></i>Confirmer l’envoi</button></div>
  </div></div>
</div>
